	(text "Bus-powered: VREGIN from VBUS\nVBUS sense pin via 22.1k/47.5k\nVDD = internal 3.3 V regulator output\nVIO tied to VDD, 4.7uF + 100nF per power pin.\nProgram the USB product string with\nSimplicity Studio XpressConfigurator after assembly."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 17.272 141.478 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "ecc475f3-a306-458c-9926-43e68fc754c9")
	)
	(text "Buffer to disable the serial when no VBUS\n\nU6 SN74LVC2G126: both OE from VBUS_DET.\nA: ESP_TX0 -> BRG_RXD. B: BRG_TXD -> ESP_RX0.\n10k keeps ESP_RX0 high with no cable.\nU6 VCC is BRG_3V3 (bus-powered).\nwith no cable the buffer is unpowered (Ioff outputs) so\nno LVC quiescent/float current on the battery."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 203.454 135.636 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
				(thickness 0.1875)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "fdd5f904-5e9d-4f68-b957-ecb7f1299ee4")
	)
	(text "E-ink display. J3 10-pin JST SH cable connecting carrier to panel board.\n\nThe SSD1680 ZIF, boost/charge-pump cluster, and the front-light 6-pin ZIFs\nlive on a separate panel board. This connects the SPI channel, provides\nmeasurement points, and also provides a clamped power for the Front Light.\nFront Light expects 3 or 4 LEDs from Vf 3.3V to vF 2.8V."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 165.862 18.288 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
				(thickness 0.1588)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "fe14ddb9-f9fe-4fdc-bf1c-d0699161bc86")
	)
